## Quick-Start Checklist

After scaffolding, complete these steps before your first deployment:

- [ ] Fill in `src/{{ project }}/config.toml` — catalog names, Volumes path, webhook URL
- [ ] Replace every `<data_science_module_file_path>` placeholder in the pipeline config YAMLs with the actual Python class paths from the `{{ ds_project }}` package
- [ ] Replace `<catalog.schema.table>` in `pipeline_configs/*/data.yml` with your raw-data table name
- [ ] Place the `{{ ds_project }}` wheel in `ds_backend/`
- [ ] Review cluster variables in `databricks.yml` (`spark_version`, `node_type_id`, `min/max_workers`)
- [ ] Set `WEBHOOK_URL` in `config.toml` (Google Chat incoming webhook for notifications)

