## Configuration Reference (`config.toml`)

```toml
[dev]
WORKSPACE_URL         # Databricks workspace URL — auto-filled by Copier
VOLUMES_ROOT_PATH     # /Volumes/<catalog>/<schema>/<volume> — output folder root
AUDIT_TARGET_CATALOG  # Unity Catalog catalog for the audit table
AUDIT_TARGET_SCHEMA   # Schema inside AUDIT_TARGET_CATALOG (default: "default")
AUDIT_TARGET_TABLE    # Audit table name (default: mlops_{{ project }}_audit_tbl)
MODEL_CATALOG         # Unity Catalog catalog for models, features, and predictions
MODEL_SCHEMA          # Schema inside MODEL_CATALOG
MODEL_CATALOG_SCHEMA  # Convenience shorthand: "<MODEL_CATALOG>.<MODEL_SCHEMA>"
WEBHOOK_URL           # Google Chat incoming webhook URL
```

All three environments (`dev`, `qa`, `prod`) must define the same keys.

