## What the DS Team Needs to Implement

The scaffold calls into the `{{ ds_project }}` package via `class_path` entries in the pipeline config YAMLs. Each class receives `kwargs` from the YAML and must expose a `run()` method.

| Class | Called from | Signature hint |
|---|---|---|
| Preprocessor | `preprocess.yml` | `run(df) → DataFrame or CSV` |
| Feature pipeline | `featurization.yml` | `fit(df) → pipeline artifact + features DataFrame` |
| Inference feature pipeline | `inference/featurization.yml` | `transform(df) → features DataFrame` |
| `HyperparameterTuner` | `train.yml` | `run() → best params dict` |
| `ModelEvaluator` | `train.yml` | `run() → metrics dict` |
| `ModelTrainer` | `train.yml` | `run() → trained sklearn model + optional scaler` |
| `BatchScoring` | `inference.yml` | `run() → predictions DataFrame` |

Replace every `<data_science_module_file_path>` placeholder in the config YAMLs with the actual dotted import path, e.g.:

```yaml
class_path: {{ ds_project }}.preprocessing.pipeline:DataPreprocessor
```

