## Databricks Bundle Variables

All variables are defined in `databricks.yml` and can be overridden per target or at runtime:

| Variable | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `mlops_project_library` | `./dist/{{ project }}-1.0.0-py3-none-any.whl` | Built MLOps package path |
| `data_science_project_library` | `./ds_backend/*.whl` | DS project wheel path |
| `run_time_env` | `dev` | Runtime environment passed to `config.toml` key lookup |
| `spark_version` | `15.4.x-scala2.12` | Databricks Runtime version |
| `node_type_id` | `Standard_D8a_v4` | Worker instance type |
| `min_workers` | `1` | Autoscale minimum workers |
| `max_workers` | `2` | Autoscale maximum workers |
